{"_v":1,"id":"giant-west-end-2025","cat":"west-end","cs":87.06,"rc":14,"bd":{"positive":12,"mixed":2,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Georgina Brown","o":"Daily Mail","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-14670075/Funny-shocking-thought-provoking-John-Lithgows-towering-performance-brings-big-unfriendly-giant-Roald-Dahl-life-West-End.html","d":"2025-05-02","q":"Funny, shocking, thought-provoking, controversial, superbly staged (Nick Hytner) and performed, this play is all that theatre should be."},{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/giant-harold-pinter-roald-dahl-b1225660.html","d":"2025-05-02","q":"This is a terrific piece of work all round, that’s already been showered with Olivier and Critic’s Circle awards."},{"cn":"Tim Bano","o":"Evening Standard","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/giant-royal-court-review-john-lithgow-romola-garai-b1184513.html"},{"cn":"Dominic Maxwell","o":"The Times (UK)","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/article/ecd0bc1e-6fb8-4627-9884-bbc6e6f8768c","d":"2025-05-02","q":"There are laughs and there are gasps as John Lithgow's sometimes delightful, sometimes horrible, always compelling Roald Dahl fills the air with his nonsense."},{"cn":"Clive Davis","o":"The Times (UK)","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.thetimes.com/culture/theatre-dance/article/giant-review-john-lithgow-roald-dahl-royal-court-s8jwhttpv"},{"cn":"Tim Bano","o":"Time Out London","s":100,"b":"Rave","t":1,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/giant-review-3","d":"2025-05-02","q":"What does come out is pretty spectacular."},{"cn":"Patrick Marmion","o":"Daily Mail","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.dailymail.co.uk/tvshowbiz/article-13897381/Giant-review-Roald-Dahls-uncomfortable-views-royal-court.html"},{"cn":"Fiona Mountford","o":"The i","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://inews.co.u